{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13220660","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13220660","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1322066001:1":{"text":"이번에 만든 장난감 목마는 꽤 괜찮아 보이는군...","source_cn":"这次的玩具木马做得真不错……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF90DF12492DD761","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322066002:0":{"text":"데이먼이 정말 좋아할 거예요! 도움 정말 감사합니다, 후긴 씨. 당신은 정말 대단한 장인이네요.","source_cn":"戴蒙一定会很喜欢的！非常感谢你的帮助，呼金先生。你真是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3F6721009F5BE2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322066003:1":{"text":"허허, 듣기 좋은 말이군! 하지만 이 목마는 “꽤 괜찮다”라고 하긴 힘들어. 이건 그저 어쩔 수 없이 만들어낸 것이니까!","source_cn":"嚯嚯，这句话我爱听！但这个木马可不算“真不错”，只是勉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC887E913A380A81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322066004:1":{"text":"색이 모자란다고 생각하지 않아? 색! 아이언 헤드와 샤프 휘슬의 이름을 걸고, 색이 없는 창조물은 진정한 창조물이라 할 수 없다는 걸 알려주지!","source_cn":"你们不觉得它缺了点颜色吗？颜色！以铁头和尖哨的名义，没...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41F27FC7C87724E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1322066005:0":{"text":"제가 눈알이랑 내장을 준비했어요...","source_cn":"我准备了眼球和内脏……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72504F33E7568974","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1322066006:1":{"text":"뭐?! 너희들, 새로 태어난 이 아이에게 그 피범벅인 것들로 뭘 하려는 거야!?","source_cn":"什么？！你们要用那些血淋淋的东西对这个新诞生的孩子做什么！？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82F0E1F93A3A1A58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1322066007:1":{"text":"평범함 페인트를 준비하라고! 정상적인!","source_cn":"准备点正常的涂料！正常的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9BF2B7323EA221E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1322066008:1":{"text":"식물, 껍데기, 광석의 가루로 가공된 평범한 페인트 말이야. 너희 그레이브본의 방식으로 이해하지 말고, 알겠지!?","source_cn":"我说正常，是指用植物、螺壳、矿石粉末加工成的普通颜料。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1A0E43BFD702D9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1322066009:1":{"text":"...자, 그럼 이만. 나, 샤프 휘슬 그리고 아이언 헤드 모두 피곤하니 가서 한숨 푹 자야겠어...","source_cn":"……好啦，就这样吧。我、尖哨和铁头都困了，得回去好好睡...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE22EBBB22F9D04EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1322066010:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 다음에 제대로 한 턱 쏘라고!","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7D4B28866470AA1D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 다음에 제대로 한 턱 쏘라고!","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 다음에 제대로 한 턱 쏘라고!","variant_male_record_index":"154792","variant_female_record_index":"154793","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1322066011:1":{"text":"...신기한 기술이네. 소리가 사라졌어.","source_cn":"……神奇的技术。没声音了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7A2D2E17068BF3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1322066012:0":{"text":"통신이 끊겼으니까요!","source_cn":"因为通讯断了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x430A4D395A84C7C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1322066013:1":{"text":"“평범한 페인트”가 필요하다니... 여보, 이 천 조각으로 장식을 하면 어떨까요? 이런 무늬를 데이먼이 좋아할까요?","source_cn":"需要“正常的颜料”啊……亲爱的，你觉得这块纺布做装饰怎...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D062C5F07DE611A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1322066014:1":{"text":"당연하지! 당신의 손은 차갑지만, 실은 뽑는 건 여전히 이렇게나 정교하군...","source_cn":"当然会了！你的手虽然冰冷，但纺起纱来仍然这么精巧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x620829D81DAB64D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1322066015:0":{"text":"여러분, 잠시만. 장인이 말한 그 페인트는 나와 세미라가 가서 찾을게... 허허, 이런 사소한 일까지 부탁할 순 없지.","source_cn":"朋友们，稍等，我和雪米拉去找些工匠所说的颜料……呵呵，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A72FFF4D309049B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:29:1322066016:0":{"text":"우리의 도움 덕에 이내 색이 예쁘게 칠해진 목마가 완성되었다","source_cn":"在你们的帮助下，上好色的木马很快完成了","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81650502CAC8262F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1322066017:1":{"text":"정말 신기한 경험이었네. 해부와 해체가 아닌 재조합과 조립이라니...","source_cn":"真是奇妙的体验，不是解剖拆卸，而是重新组合装配……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCCD219082D6AC25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:30::2":{"text":"색칠된 목마","source_cn":"上色后的木马","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60D1139F100EE865","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1322066018:1":{"text":"여보, 이 물건을 우리 아들에게 가져다주도록 해요. 분명 이 선물을 좋아할 거예요...","source_cn":"亲爱的，把这件小东西拿给我们的儿子吧。他一定会喜欢这件...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BD780567B191129","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:尼汝":{"text":"니루","source":"尼汝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:雪米拉":{"text":"세미라","source":"雪米拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"s